    {
      "id": "claim_20def24b11884cc1b910cafac1a32a25",
      "statement": "There is no scheduled maintenance job: on a feature branch the wiki is refreshed through the feature-completion checklist, and on `main` only by the merge-triggered workflow — neither has a `schedule:` trigger.",
