    {
      "id": "claim_a608aa084a934cbebf1ec20f72c134c9",
      "statement": "`scripts/wiki-maintain.mjs` never consults the generator's exit status: it judges a slice by the pages that landed in the working tree, by bundle conformance and by whether the regeneration policy permitted every written path, because feature 043 measured 12 minutes of paid work writing one `index.md` and exiting 0.",
