      "id": "claim_f4b5c974cd30421092ced1846e62e8b4",
      "statement": "Maintenance exit code 3 means the run stopped at its page or wall-clock budget with work carried forward in the committed backlog and is explicitly not a failure; the workflow treats 0 and 3 as the two non-broken outcomes and reports 1 and 2 as failures.",
