    {
      "id": "claim_5de4493924d5461ba93709d5216588b7",
      "statement": "The run record `openwiki/.maintenance-state.json` is committed because runners are ephemeral, and it is distinct from the tool's own `openwiki/.last-update.json`; the marker commit is pushed with a `[skip ci]` marker so the workflow does not trigger itself.",
