      "statement": "The OKF conformance gate (`scripts/check-openwiki-okf.mjs`) is offline, keyless and fail-closed with no skip flag, resolving repository-relative `resource` links against the working tree while only shape-checking external ones, so it cannot fail because a third-party host is down; drift rule V12 is the sole rule that warns without affecting the exit code.",
