      "statement": "Rule V16 holds a page that openwiki has covered (an entry in `openwiki/.page-manifest.json`) to the sha256 its verified Claims sidecar certifies, with the invariant defined once in `scripts/openwiki-claims.mjs`; a hand edit of such a page makes openwiki refuse every later run until the page is uncovered.",
