      "statement": "The `mermaid` and `jsdom` packages are optional peer dependencies of the generator whose absence is silent: a diagram that fails the strict check is rewritten in place into a plain `text` fence, with a comment naming the parser error, while the run still exits 0 and every gate still passes — so guard tests assert that the toolchain image and the wiki workflow install the same parser set.",
