    {
      "id": "claim_193202092d274b56b1f84b2ec802ca5a",
      "statement": "The managed `<!-- OPENWIKI:START -->…<!-- OPENWIKI:END -->` block in `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` must already be byte-identical to what the pinned generator writes, because openwiki rewrites that block on every run while the regeneration policy permits only an agent to write `AGENTS.md`; a mismatch would fail every slice and hold the marker indefinitely.",
