      "id": "claim_523bbc1221e940a0942ce0cda25ec531",
      "statement": "The generation brief, the regeneration policy and the protection manifest are all declared never-written, because a process must not be able to rewrite the file that constrains it; the brief is the sole remediation surface when a gate rejects generated content, since the gates have no allowlist.",
