      "statement": "The governance gate (`scripts/check-openwiki-governance.mjs`) is offline, keyless and fail-closed with no skip flag, and checks that every documentation path carries a declared regeneration policy, that `actor: generator` appears only inside the bundle, that every event-driven entry names its events, that protected passages still match their fingerprints (a removed passage failing as a removal), and that `CLAUDE.md` holds only its index and machine-managed regions.",
